      "text": "$47.2 \\mathrm{~Hz}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "By the concept of accoustic, the observer and source are moving towards each other, each with a velocity of $18 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$ $\\therefore \\mathrm{v}^{\\prime}=\\frac{330+18}{330-18} \\times 1000 \\approx 1115 \\mathrm{~Hz}$",
    "image": null
  },
